# English: inputs and outputs in words

run this with seed 14, for input 1 use pure black nofile
```glsl
#version 450
layout(binding = 0) uniform sampler2D a;
layout(binding = 1) uniform sampler2D b;
layout(location = 0) in vec2 uv;
layout(location = 0) out vec4 o;
void main() { o = texture(a, uv) * 0.5 + texture(b, uv) * 0.5; }
```

